<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN GERMAN FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN GERMAN FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the German</p>
<p>first division after Tuesday's games:</p>
<p>16 - Fredi Bobic (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
<p>14 - Sean Dundee (Karlsruhe)</p>
<p>13 - Giovane Elber (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
<p>12 - Andreas Herzog (Werder Bremen), Paulo Sergio (Bayer</p>
<p>Leverkusen), Bernhard Winkler (1860 Munich)</p>
<p>11 - Ulf Kirsten (Bayer Leverkusen), Jonathan Akpoborie (Hansa</p>
<p>Rostock), Martin Max (Schalke)</p>
<p>9 - Toni Polster (Cologne), Juergen Klinsmann (Bayern Munich)</p>
</text>
